---
import BaseLayout from 'theme/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from 'theme/components/Hero.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from 'theme/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CTABand from 'theme/components/CTABand.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', item: '/' },
  { name: 'Moving Guides', item: '/moving-guides/' },
  { name: '8-Week Moving House Checklist', item: '/moving-guides/8-week-moving-house-checklist/' }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="8-Week Moving House Checklist | Complete UK Moving Timeline"
  description="Follow our comprehensive 8-week moving house checklist. From conveyancer paperwork and decluttering to utility changeovers and completion day packing."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <Hero
    variant="blog"
    title="The Ultimate 8-Week Moving House Checklist"
    subtitle="A structured week-by-week timeline to eliminate moving stress, coordinate solicitors, and ensure an effortless move day."
    badge="Checklists & Timelines"
    author="Jimmys Removals Operations Team"
    date="19 September 2026"
    readingTimeText="6 min read"
  />

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Moving house is widely regarded as one of life’s most demanding milestones. Breaking down your tasks into an 8-week structured roadmap ensures nothing gets overlooked between exchange and completion.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Week 8: Declutter & Request Early Removal Quotes</h2>
      <p>
        Begin by sorting room by room. Categorise items into keep, donate, sell, or clear. Booking a survey with a reputable removal company like Jimmys Removals 8 weeks in advance gives you accurate cubic footage assessments and lock-in rates.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Week 6: School Transfers & Packing Materials</h2>
      <p>
        Notify schools, doctors, and dentists. Order double-walled removal boxes, packing tape, bubble wrap, and wardrobe cartons so you can begin packing seasonal clothing and seldom-used loft items.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Week 4: Exchange of Contracts & Parking Permits</h2>
      <p>
        Once exchange occurs, your completion date is legally binding. Apply to Birmingham City Council or your local authority for removal van parking bay suspensions or resident dispenser dispensations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Week 2: Utilities & Change of Address</h2>
      <p>
        Contact broadband providers, energy suppliers, water companies, and council tax departments. Arrange Royal Mail postal redirection to protect your identity.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Moving Week: Essentials Box & Completion Day</h2>
      <p>
        Pack an essentials survival box: kettle, mugs, tea, phone chargers, toiletries, important legal documents, and children's essentials. Your Jimmys Removals crew arrives promptly on move day to load, transit, and position your furniture in your new home.
      </p>
    </div>

    <CTABand
      heading="Ready to Book Your Birmingham Move?"
      subheading="Get an itemised fixed quote with no hidden charges. DBS-checked movers and £50k insurance cover."
      primaryCtaText="Get a Free Quote"
      primaryCtaHref="/get-a-quote/"
    />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
